Mythix DualShock 4 support for winebus (hidraw), mythix-11.11 tree
=================================================================

Origin : patches/mythix-ds4/0001 (Luna's in-tree edits to the Neutron-11.0-21199
         source), rebased onto the mythix-11.11 tree (Valve bleeding-edge 91e9e8f +
         TkG 11.11 + GE). Same changes; one hunk is re-anchored because
         udev_add_device's Steam virtual controller branch differs here.
Applies: the mythix-11.11 tree (legacy pipeline, source key mythix-wine)

What it does:
  * dlls/winebus.sys/bus_udev.c — Sony controller detection on hidraw, HID descriptor
    augmentation with Wine's haptics reports, haptics → native DS4 rumble translation
    (0x05 USB / 0x11 BT), passthrough of native DS4 output reports (LED control),
    evdev path no longer drops devices on the SDL ignore list
  * dlls/winebus.sys/main.c — hidraw on by default again (DisableHidraw=0, Valve's
    default). The TkG 11.11 layer carries mainline Wine's default of 1, which left
    hidraw off: SDL then handed games an Xbox-style copy of the pad (Xbox glyphs,
    no raw DS4 for native PlayStation support). DisableInput keeps TkG's 1. A
    prefix can still set DisableHidraw=1 under Services\winebus.
  * dlls/hidclass.sys/pnp.c — don't toggle a device interface that was never registered
